			"notes": "__New Stuff__\n- > Reach HUD\n- > IRL Time HUD\n- > Combo HUD\n- > TPS HUD\n- > Compass HUD\n- - > View direction with full on 360. Fades in/out. Looks really nice. Very customizable.\n\nScoreboard HUD\n- > Should be faster\n- > Adding top padding and outline options\n\nPlayer HUD\n- > Now have dynamic rotation (on by default) that shows rotation of character\n\nDynamic Positioning and Size\n- > Set an anchor point on most modules so when it's resized it maintains that anchor point. This can keep stuff centered, justified right, justified top left...\n\nText Entries\n- > Text HUD's now have a dynamic width and a customizable minimum width\n- > Text HUD's now have a justify option\n\nPotion HUD\n- > Background and outline option now\n- > It can now be horizontal\n- > It can now just be icons\n\n__Bug Fixes__\n\nScoreboard\n- > Scoreboard now isn't massive (it's also dynamically sized!)\n- > Placeholder now shows (and it has a little easter egg of cool people)\n```\n\n__Misc__\n\n- > A lot of refactoring is taking place behind the scenes. This improves performance and makes the code a lot prettier. I learned a lot in the past year.\n- > Looking for new ideas to implement! I feel like more 3d one's would be cool (maybe like current block you're standing on or similar?"
